========================================================================================
COST IN GLUCOSE EXPOSURE, WHICH IS THE CURRENCY THAT MATTERS
========================================================================================
  Insulin removed is not the cost of an arm. The cost is the hyperglycaemia accepted
  in exchange, and it differs by a factor of forty between these arms because a late
  commit delivers into a meal that has already peaked.

  arm                       avoided  total mg/dL.h  per low avoided
  uniform                       313          34142            109.1
  oracle-late                    29            799             27.6
  oracle-small                  170           6333             37.3

